		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Receiver immune to strong signals. DR-1801 (not DM)]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4440&amp;p=33245#p33245"><![CDATA[
The receiver of DR-1801 is unlike most Chinese radios not affected by strong signals on other frequencies. It does not loose sensitivity when they are present. The radio can be used with roof antenna in city center and close to FM broadcast transmitters, in locations where most of other Baofeng/Quansheng/Radioditty become dump after connecting an outside antenna.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6994">SO5MC</a> — Sat Sep 28, 2024 1:19 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
